nd some leisurely time. Not just on weekends, but on weekdays too—or rather, especially on weekdays."],"sets":[["",5,220],["",5,180],["",5,270],["",5,250]]},"medals":{"list":[["medal_hidden_54side_01","Faithful Companion","T2","During the event The Moon Walks on Water, obtain Operator Koromaru","You provided a place of rest for the much-loved 'Perro Beast Steward'.\nOf course, you know where Koromaru really comes from. Perhaps that is exactly why he enjoys your company. No matter who you are, it feels good to be yourself in the company of friends.",1],["medal_hidden_54side_02","Farewells Must Come","T2","During the event The Moon Walks on Water, complete all stages in [The Way to School] with 3-star ratings (excluding tutorials and story stages)","You befriended students who had come from far away, and watched them return to their own paths.\nTime waits for no one, and every meeting must one day end in parting—you understand this well. Bid farewell to the life that was, to an era that has drawn to a close, to the self that cannot let go, and believe that hope keeps rolling onward, and that the future is still waiting.",1]]},"story":{"id":"act54side","eps":[["SR-ST-1","Interlude"],["SR-1","Before Operation"],["SR-2","Before Operation"],["SR-3","Before Operation"],["SR-4","Before Operation"],["SR-5","Before Operation"],["SR-6","Before Operation"],["SR-6","After Operation"],["SR-7","Before Operation"],["SR-7","After Operation"],["SR-8","Before Operation"],["SR-8","After Operation"],["SR-ST-2","Interlude"]],"sum":1,"scene":1}}